# Post-mortems

Pour chaque incident en prod (downtime, data loss, security event), copier le
template et écrire un post-mortem dans ce dossier.

Template :

```markdown
# YYYY-MM-DD — Short title

**Status** : Resolved / Ongoing / Mitigated
**Severity** : Critical / High / Medium / Low
**Detected at** : YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM (timezone)
**Resolved at** : YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM
**Detected by** : Sentry / UptimeRobot / User report / Telegram alert / etc.

## Summary
1-2 sentences describing what happened.

## Impact
- Number of users affected
- Duration
- Data lost / corrupted (if any)

## Timeline
- HH:MM — Event 1
- HH:MM — Event 2 (mitigation applied)
- HH:MM — Resolution confirmed

## Root cause
Why this happened.

## Fix (immediate)
What was done in the moment.

## Prevention (long-term)
What changes are landing to prevent recurrence.

## Action items
- [ ] Owner — task
- [ ] Owner — task
```
